---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Bpeace / Breaking the $1M Barrier | Ethnoir"
  description="How Ethnoir supported implementation of Bpeace’s Breaking the $1M Barrier program across North Carolina and Georgia."
>
  <!-- BACK NAVIGATION -->
  <div class="bg-parchment" style="padding-top: var(--space-lg); padding-bottom: var(--space-sm); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-strong-boundary);">
    <div class="container">
      <a href="/our-work" class="link-secondary" style="font-size: 0.875rem; text-decoration: none; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; color: var(--color-muted-slate);">
        &larr; Back to Our Work
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- 1. OPENING MASTHEAD -->
  <section class="bg-parchment" style="padding: var(--space-2xl) 0 var(--space-xl) 0;">
    <div class="container grid-12">
      <div class="col-12 lg-col-11">
        <div style="margin-bottom: var(--space-xs);">
          <span class="voice-3" style="color: var(--color-muted-slate); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.08em; font-size: 0.8125rem;">
            Bpeace / Breaking the $1M Barrier
          </span>
        </div>
        <h1 class="voice-1" style="font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 5.5vw, 4.5rem); margin: 0 0 var(--space-lg) 0; line-height: 1.08; letter-spacing: -0.025em; color: var(--color-tidal-ink);">
          Coordinating the People and Processes Behind a Founder-Support Program
        </h1>
        <p class="voice-2" style="font-size: clamp(1.2rem, 2.2vw, 1.45rem); line-height: 1.45; color: var(--color-deep-teal); max-width: 820px; margin: 0 0 var(--space-lg) 0;">
          How Ethnoir supported implementation of Bpeace’s Breaking the $1M Barrier program across North Carolina and Georgia.
        </p>
        <p class="voice-2" style="font-size: 1.125rem; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--color-deep-body); max-width: 820px; margin: 0;">
          Ethnoir’s work connected program goals with the preparation, facilitation, coordination and operating processes needed for delivery. The engagement brought together program implementation, contributor guidance, peer learning, founder onboarding and regional Showcase preparation.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 2. AT A GLANCE -->
  <section class="bg-quiet-sand chapter chapter-moderate-spacing" style="border-top: 1px solid var(--color-strong-boundary);">
    <div class="container grid-12">
      <div class="col-12 md-col-4 lg-col-3" style="margin-bottom: var(--space-md);">
        <h2 class="voice-1" style="font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 3vw, 2.25rem); color: var(--color-tidal-ink); line-height: 1.15; margin: 0;">
          At a glance
        </h2>
      </div>
      <div class="col-12 md-col-8 lg-col-9">
        <div class="glance-ledger">
          <div class="glance-row">
            <span class="glance-label">Organization</span>
            <span class="glance-value">Bpeace</span>
          </div>
          <div class="glance-row">
            <span class="glance-label">Program</span>
            <span class="glance-value">Breaking the $1M Barrier</span>
          </div>
          <div class="glance-row">
            <span class="glance-label">Engagement</span>
            <span class="glance-value">Program implementation and coordination</span>
          </div>
          <div class="glance-row">
            <span class="glance-label">Delivery role</span>
            <span class="glance-value">U.S. Program Manager (Contract)</span>
          </div>
          <div class="glance-row">
            <span class="glance-label">Period</span>
            <span class="glance-value">September 2025&ndash;June 2026</span>
          </div>
          <div class="glance-row">
            <span class="glance-label">Geography</span>
            <span class="glance-value">North Carolina and Georgia</span>
          </div>
          <div class="glance-row">
            <span class="glance-label">Program context</span>
            <span class="glance-value">A cohort of 21 companies, with closing Showcases in Atlanta and Greensboro.</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 3. THE PROGRAM CONTEXT -->
  <section class="bg-porcelain chapter chapter-moderate-spacing" style="border-top: 1px solid var(--color-strong-boundary);">
    <div class="container grid-12">
      <div class="col-12 md-col-4 lg-col-3" style="margin-bottom: var(--space-md);">
        <h2 class="voice-1" style="font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 3vw, 2.25rem); color: var(--color-tidal-ink); line-height: 1.15; margin: 0;">
          The program context
        </h2>
      </div>
      <div class="col-12 md-col-8 lg-col-9">
        <div style="border-left: 1px solid var(--color-strong-boundary); padding-left: clamp(var(--space-md), 3vw, var(--space-xl)); max-width: 760px;">
          <p class="voice-2" style="font-size: 1.125rem; line-height: 1.65; color: var(--color-deep-body-ink); margin-bottom: var(--space-md);">
            Bpeace’s Breaking the $1M Barrier program brought together coaching, group learning and opportunities for founders to present their businesses and receive feedback.
          </p>
          <p class="voice-2" style="font-size: 1.125rem; line-height: 1.65; color: var(--color-deep-body-ink); margin: 0;">
            Delivering that experience involved founders, program staff, volunteer specialists, coaches, facilitators and regional stakeholders. The implementation task was to connect those contributions with the program’s goals and the preparation needed at each stage.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 4. ETHNOIR'S CONTRIBUTION -->
  <section class="bg-parchment chapter chapter-large-spacing" style="border-top: 1px solid var(--color-strong-boundary);">
    <div class="container grid-12">
      <div class="col-12 md-col-4 lg-col-3" style="margin-bottom: var(--space-lg);">
        <h2 class="voice-1" style="font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 3vw, 2.25rem); color: var(--color-tidal-ink); line-height: 1.15; margin: 0;">
          Ethnoir’s contribution
        </h2>
      </div>
      <div class="col-12 md-col-8 lg-col-9">
        <div style="border-left: 1px solid var(--color-strong-boundary); padding-left: clamp(var(--space-md), 3vw, var(--space-xl)); max-width: 780px;">
          <p class="voice-2" style="font-size: 1.1875rem; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--color-tidal-ink); margin-bottom: var(--space-xs);">
            Ethnoir supported the operating infrastructure around the program: preparing contributors, clarifying expectations, coordinating activities and connecting learning with implementation.
          </p>
          <p class="voice-2" style="font-size: 1.0625rem; line-height: 1.5; color: var(--color-deep-teal); margin-bottom: var(--space-xl); font-weight: 500;">
            The work included five connected areas.
          </p>

          <div class="areas-list">
            <!-- Area 1 -->
            <div class="area-item">
              <h3 class="voice-1" style="font-size: 1.25rem; color: var(--color-tidal-ink); margin: 0 0 var(--space-xs) 0; line-height: 1.25;">
                Preparing coaches and facilitators
              </h3>
              <p class="voice-2" style="font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--color-deep-body-ink); margin: 0;">
                Created guidance for coaches and facilitators to clarify responsibilities, expectations and delivery requirements. This preparation connected individual contributions with the wider program experience.
              </p>
            </div>

            <!-- Area 2 -->
            <div class="area-item">
              <h3 class="voice-1" style="font-size: 1.25rem; color: var(--color-tidal-ink); margin: 0 0 var(--space-xs) 0; line-height: 1.25;">
                Designing and facilitating peer learning
              </h3>
              <p class="voice-2" style="font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--color-deep-body-ink); margin: 0;">
                Designed and facilitated peer-learning sessions within the program’s shared learning offer. This contribution combined learning design with direct facilitation.
              </p>
            </div>

            <!-- Area 3 -->
            <div class="area-item">
              <h3 class="voice-1" style="font-size: 1.25rem; color: var(--color-tidal-ink); margin: 0 0 var(--space-xs) 0; line-height: 1.25;">
                Shaping onboarding and Showcase preparation
              </h3>
              <p class="voice-2" style="font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--color-deep-body-ink); margin: 0;">
                Substantially shaped founder onboarding and regional Showcase preparation, contributing to the activities and guidance surrounding participation and presentation.
              </p>
            </div>

            <!-- Area 4 -->
            <div class="area-item">
              <h3 class="voice-1" style="font-size: 1.25rem; color: var(--color-tidal-ink); margin: 0 0 var(--space-xs) 0; line-height: 1.25;">
                Coordinating contributors and stakeholders
              </h3>
              <p class="voice-2" style="font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--color-deep-body-ink); margin: 0;">
                Coordinated contributors and stakeholder engagement across the founder experience, working within Bpeace’s delivery team and alongside volunteer specialists and facilitators.
              </p>
            </div>

            <!-- Area 5 -->
            <div class="area-item">
              <h3 class="voice-1" style="font-size: 1.25rem; color: var(--color-tidal-ink); margin: 0 0 var(--space-xs) 0; line-height: 1.25;">
                Contributing to reporting and learning
              </h3>
              <p class="voice-2" style="font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--color-deep-body-ink); margin: 0;">
                Contributed to internal reporting and learning synthesis, connecting implementation experience with program review.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 5. FROM PROGRAM GOALS TO COORDINATED DELIVERY -->
  <section class="bg-porcelain chapter chapter-moderate-spacing" style="border-top: 1px solid var(--color-strong-boundary);">
    <div class="container grid-12">
      <div class="col-12 md-col-4 lg-col-3" style="margin-bottom: var(--space-md);">
        <h2 class="voice-1" style="font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 3vw, 2.25rem); color: var(--color-tidal-ink); line-height: 1.15; margin: 0;">
          From program goals to coordinated delivery
        </h2>
      </div>
      <div class="col-12 md-col-8 lg-col-9">
        <div style="border-left: 1px solid var(--color-strong-boundary); padding-left: clamp(var(--space-md), 3vw, var(--space-xl)); max-width: 760px;">
          <p class="voice-2" style="font-size: 1.125rem; line-height: 1.65; color: var(--color-deep-body-ink); margin-bottom: var(--space-md);">
            The engagement required movement between design and execution. Guidance needed to connect with facilitation; onboarding needed to connect with participation; and Showcase preparation needed to connect founders, contributors and regional activities.
          </p>
          <p class="voice-2" style="font-size: 1.125rem; line-height: 1.65; color: var(--color-deep-body-ink); margin-bottom: var(--space-md);">
            Ethnoir’s contribution focused on these connections—turning program intentions into practical preparation and coordinated work across the people involved.
          </p>
          <div style="background-color: var(--color-parchment); border: 1px solid var(--color-quiet-rule); border-left: 3px solid var(--color-deep-teal); padding: var(--space-md); border-radius: 2px;">
            <p class="voice-2" style="font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--color-tidal-ink); margin: 0;">
              Bpeace provided the program and institutional direction. Its team and volunteer specialists contributed coordination, expertise and delivery, while participating founders developed and applied the work within their businesses.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 6. DELIVERY IN CONTEXT -->
  <section class="bg-quiet-sand chapter chapter-moderate-spacing" style="border-top: 1px solid var(--color-strong-boundary);">
    <div class="container grid-12">
      <div class="col-12 md-col-4 lg-col-3" style="margin-bottom: var(--space-md);">
        <h2 class="voice-1" style="font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 3vw, 2.25rem); color: var(--color-tidal-ink); line-height: 1.15; margin: 0;">
          Delivery in context
        </h2>
      </div>
      <div class="col-12 md-col-8 lg-col-9">
        <div style="border-left: 1px solid var(--color-strong-boundary); padding-left: clamp(var(--space-md), 3vw, var(--space-xl)); max-width: 760px;">
          <p class="voice-2" style="font-size: 1.125rem; line-height: 1.5; color: var(--color-deep-teal); margin-bottom: var(--space-md); font-weight: 500;">
            Bpeace’s public updates describe:
          </p>
          <ul class="editorial-list voice-2" style="margin-bottom: var(--space-lg);">
            <li>A cohort of 21 companies across North Carolina and Georgia.</li>
            <li>Coaching and group-learning components.</li>
            <li>Two closing Showcases in Atlanta and Greensboro.</li>
            <li>Opportunities for founders to present their businesses and receive feedback.</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="voice-2" style="font-size: 1.0625rem; line-height: 1.65; color: var(--color-deep-body-ink); margin: 0;">
            These facts establish the setting and scale of the program. Ethnoir’s contribution centered on implementation, contributor preparation, facilitation, onboarding, Showcase preparation, stakeholder coordination and reporting.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 7. WHAT THIS WORK ILLUSTRATES -->
  <section class="bg-porcelain chapter chapter-large-spacing" style="border-top: 1px solid var(--color-strong-boundary);">
    <div class="container">
      <div style="text-align: center; max-width: 720px; margin: 0 auto var(--space-xl);">
        <h2 class="voice-1" style="font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 2.75rem); color: var(--color-tidal-ink); margin: 0 0 var(--space-xs) 0; line-height: 1.15;">
          What this work illustrates
        </h2>
      </div>

      <div class="grid-12">
        <!-- Card 1 -->
        <div class="col-12 md-col-4" style="margin-bottom: var(--space-lg);">
          <div class="illustrate-card">
            <h3 class="voice-1" style="font-size: 1.25rem; color: var(--color-tidal-ink); margin-bottom: var(--space-sm); line-height: 1.25;">
              Contributor preparation is part of program delivery
            </h3>
            <p class="voice-2" style="font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--color-deep-body-ink); margin: 0;">
              Guidance for coaches and facilitators connects program intentions with the people responsible for carrying them forward. Preparation belongs within the delivery design.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Card 2 -->
        <div class="col-12 md-col-4" style="margin-bottom: var(--space-lg);">
          <div class="illustrate-card">
            <h3 class="voice-1" style="font-size: 1.25rem; color: var(--color-tidal-ink); margin-bottom: var(--space-sm); line-height: 1.25;">
              The participant experience crosses multiple activities
            </h3>
            <p class="voice-2" style="font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--color-deep-body-ink); margin: 0;">
              Onboarding, coaching, peer learning and presentation opportunities form parts of one experience. Coordinating their connections is an important implementation responsibility.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Card 3 -->
        <div class="col-12 md-col-4" style="margin-bottom: var(--space-lg);">
          <div class="illustrate-card">
            <h3 class="voice-1" style="font-size: 1.25rem; color: var(--color-tidal-ink); margin-bottom: var(--space-sm); line-height: 1.25;">
              Program design and operations work together
            </h3>
            <p class="voice-2" style="font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--color-deep-body-ink); margin: 0;">
              Learning activities depend on the preparation, communication and coordination around them. This engagement illustrates the connection between practical program design and the operating infrastructure supporting delivery.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 8. CAPABILITIES DEMONSTRATED -->
  <section class="bg-parchment chapter chapter-moderate-spacing" style="border-top: 1px solid var(--color-strong-boundary);">
    <div class="container grid-12">
      <div class="col-12 md-col-4 lg-col-3" style="margin-bottom: var(--space-md);">
        <h2 class="voice-1" style="font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 3vw, 2.25rem); color: var(--color-tidal-ink); line-height: 1.15; margin: 0;">
          Capabilities demonstrated
        </h2>
      </div>
      <div class="col-12 md-col-8 lg-col-9">
        <div style="border-left: 1px solid var(--color-strong-boundary); padding-left: clamp(var(--space-md), 3vw, var(--space-xl));">
          <div class="capabilities-grid">
            <div class="capability-pill">Program implementation and coordination</div>
            <div class="capability-pill">Operational systems design</div>
            <div class="capability-pill">Facilitation and learning design</div>
            <div class="capability-pill">Contributor preparation</div>
            <div class="capability-pill">Stakeholder coordination</div>
            <div class="capability-pill">Reporting and implementation learning</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 9. CLOSING CTA -->
  <section class="bg-tidal-ink chapter chapter-large-spacing" style="border-top: 1px solid var(--color-strong-boundary);">
    <div class="container text-center" style="max-width: 780px; margin: 0 auto;">
      <h2 class="voice-1" style="font-size: clamp(2.25rem, 4.5vw, 3.5rem); color: var(--color-porcelain); margin-bottom: var(--space-sm); letter-spacing: -0.02em;">
        Discuss a program or support challenge
      </h2>
      <p class="voice-2" style="font-size: clamp(1.15rem, 2vw, 1.35rem); color: var(--color-parchment); margin-bottom: var(--space-xl); line-height: 1.5; font-weight: 400;">
        If your organization is designing or improving entrepreneurship support, bring the question you are working through. We can explore the delivery needs, available information and where Ethnoir could contribute.
      </p>
      <div style="display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; gap: var(--space-md); flex-wrap: wrap;">
        <a
          href="/contact?type=institutional"
          class="btn-primary"
          style="background-color: var(--color-porcelain); color: var(--color-tidal-ink); text-decoration: none; padding: var(--space-sm) var(--space-xl); border-radius: 2px; font-weight: 600;"
        >
          Discuss an entrepreneurship-support challenge &rarr;
        </a>
        <a
          href="/our-work"
          class="voice-3"
          style="color: var(--color-parchment); text-decoration: none; padding: var(--space-sm) var(--space-md); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2); border-radius: 2px;"
        >
          Back to Our Work &rarr;
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  /* Glance Ledger */
  .glance-ledger {
    background-color: var(--color-porcelain);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-quiet-rule);
    border-radius: 2px;
  }
  .glance-row {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    padding: var(--space-sm) var(--space-md);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-quiet-rule);
  }
  .glance-row:last-child {
    border-bottom: none;
  }
  @media (min-width: 640px) {
    .glance-row {
      flex-direction: row;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: baseline;
      padding: var(--space-sm) var(--space-lg);
    }
  }
  .glance-label {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-muted-slate);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    min-width: 180px;
    margin-bottom: 4px;
  }
  @media (min-width: 640px) {
    .glance-label {
      margin-bottom: 0;
    }
  }
  .glance-value {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 1.0625rem;
    color: var(--color-tidal-ink);
    line-height: 1.5;
    flex: 1;
  }

  /* Areas List */
  .areas-list {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-md);
  }
  .area-item {
    background-color: var(--color-porcelain);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-quiet-rule);
    border-left: 3px solid var(--color-deep-teal);
    padding: var(--space-md) var(--space-lg);
    border-radius: 2px;
  }

  /* Editorial List */
  .editorial-list {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-quiet-rule);
  }
  .editorial-list li {
    padding: var(--space-sm) 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-quiet-rule);
    font-size: 1.0625rem;
    color: var(--color-tidal-ink);
    line-height: 1.55;
  }

  /* Illustrate Card */
  .illustrate-card {
    background-color: var(--color-parchment);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-quiet-rule);
    border-top: 3px solid var(--color-tidal-ink);
    padding: var(--space-lg);
    border-radius: 2px;
    height: 100%;
  }

  /* Capabilities Grid */
  .capabilities-grid {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: var(--space-sm);
  }
  .capability-pill {
    background-color: var(--color-porcelain);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-quiet-rule);
    border-left: 3px solid var(--color-deep-teal);
    padding: 10px 16px;
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--color-tidal-ink);
    border-radius: 2px;
  }
</style>
